Z||000016||frontal lobe||03-24-2001||12:14 AM||||I think the '86 or '87 GT's are the best value.  You definitely want a v6 Fiero.  I prefer the 5-speed but the 4-speed is fine.  I like the fastback look best.||||reg||1
Z||000017||dosed||03-24-2001||12:33 AM||||I've been looking for an excuse to register on this board, so now seems like a good time...<P>Here's my suggestion to somone wondering what model to buy:<P>Go IN PERSON to look at the various styles!<P>For the longest time while in search of "my Fiero," I was more biased towards the fastbacks. I don't know why, ecactly; I thought in pictures it looked better -- more sporty, or what not. To cut a possibly longer story in half, I ended up with an 85 notchback.<P>...and now, I'm starting to fall in love with the original design.<P>So the point is: actually go out and SEE them in person; pictures can say a thousand words, but I know more words than that.<P> - dosed||||reg||1
