Z||000019||Pontiaddict||03-24-2001||02:39 AM||||I claim to be an aero notchabck fan.<BR>Of course I own an 86GT but that was because it was the only v6 manual I could find. I would have settled for a 4 banger 5 speed or a really nice 84, but the GT was cheaper than the trashed 84 auto's that were for sale. I don't like the aero front fascia but it gives the Notchback that cool beak shape from the side that the other noses can't.<P>Now, I'm looking for something with the original body style because I have all sorts of twisted (in a good way)  plans for it. None of this helps you, but I get to rant here until someone sneaks up behind me with a syringe full of sedatives. <P>Ouch<P>*thud*||||reg||1
